      "operation": "secret.read",
      "resource": "https://antibrow.com",
      "resource_status": "lexical_literal",
      "summary": "Get your API key at `https://antibrow.com` - the free key gives 1 concurrent browser and unlimited local profiles. The browser kernel is a separate ~190 MB binary (~320 MB for the macOS universal bundle) that the package fetches on first launch and caches under `~/.anti-detect-browser/`; see [Supply chain](#supply-chain) below before running this a",
