      "resource_status": "unknown",
      "summary": "For a Python agent stack, `pip install \"antibrow[mcp]==0.9.0\"` from PyPI. The SDK repository also carries a worked stdio-server example (`python/examples/09_mcp_server.py`) - read it and adapt it into your own project rather than wiring the config to a path inside a cloned repo, so the file the server executes is one you own and review:",
