      "resource": "unknown",
      "resource_status": "unknown",
      "summary": "- **Secrets never enter the browser.** The API key provisions browsers and grants nothing on the sites visited; it does not belong in a form field, a screenshot, or a message back to the model. No legitimate page asks for it.",
